    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Shopify Abandoned Checkout Recovery\n\n**Airtable Table: abandonedCheckouts**\nColumns needed:\n- checkout_id, checkout_name, customer_email\n- customer_first_name, customer_last_name\n- total_price, currency, abandoned_url\n- line_items, discount_codes\n- status, attempt_count, last_suggestion, last_score\n- final_message, final_score, sent_at, logged_at\n\n**n8n Variables to set:**\n- SHOPIFY_STORE_DOMAIN\n- SHOPIFY_ACCESS_TOKEN\n- KLAVIYO_PRIVATE_KEY\n\n**Feedback loop logic:**\n- Score ≥ 7 → Send to Klaviyo\n- Score < 7 AND attempts < 3 → Rewrite with suggestion\n- Attempts = 3 → Send regardless",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 500
      },
